  <link:footnoteLink xlink:type="extended" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/link">
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH52E08191400C27D7774462C2B0EFF805" xlink:label="HH52E08191400C27D7774462C2B0EFF805" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH6023BD1B3B260B5727DB6B13405763C6" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
The Net Actual Interchange between BAs was 6989 MWh. Energy was not to serve load but for station service and contingency reserves to meet schedule obligations.</div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH52E08191400C27D7774462C2B0EFF805" xlink:to="HH6023BD1B3B260B5727DB6B13405763C6" order="1" />
